<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Control of Supplies Act 1961 [Act 122], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended by substituting for paragraph 6(2)(k) the following paragraph: “(k) limiting the quantity of any controlled article which may be acquired or held by any person or class of persons including providing for the registration of the person or class of persons, the issuance of user cards by the Controller or any person authorized by the Controller, and the imposition of conditions, fees or charges in respect of the issuance of the user cards;”. Amendment of section 20"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/28/eng@> .
